{"id":"d12ffdb5e1b32a31","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-liar-not-provable.md","title":"裸KF不能判定说谎者及其真理原子","display":"thm-liar-not-provable — 裸KF不能判定说谎者及其真理原子","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-liar-not-provable","aliases":["91-thm-liar-not-provable"],"display":"thm-liar-not-provable — 裸KF不能判定说谎者及其真理原子","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","[[91-thm-KF-soundness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-liar-not-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-liar-not-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-liar-not-provable — 裸KF不能判定说谎者及其真理原子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f276735320c6ad44\" href=\"?note=f276735320c6ad44\" title=\"91-df-fixed-point-model\">91-df-fixed-point-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cb582ee79087af80\" href=\"?note=cb582ee79087af80\" title=\"91-thm-KF-soundness\">91-thm-KF-soundness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-liar-not-provable-—-裸-KF-不能判定说谎者及其真理原子\">thm-liar-not-provable — 裸 KF 不能判定说谎者及其真理原子</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>，且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> (说谎者固定点句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (包含上述算术背景的标准裸 KF)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\min}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\)</span> (极小一致固定点诱导的经典外层 KF 模型)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm g}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm g}\\)</span> (使说谎者代码发生 glut 的经典外层 KF 模型)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\n\\left[\n\\lambda\\land\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm g}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm g}\\models\n\\left[\n\\neg\\lambda\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\\\\n\\land\\\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\lambda\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\n\\left[\n\\lambda\\land\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm g}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm g}\\models\n\\left[\n\\neg\\lambda\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\\\\n\\land\\\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\lambda\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极小固定点中的强 Kleene 评价令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 未定义；但把该真理外延放入\nKF 的经典外层结构后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 为假，\n对角式遂令外层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 为真。因此该模型反驳真理原子与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\lambda\">\\(\\neg\\lambda\\)</span> 的可证性。允许 glut 的 KF 模型可使该真理原子为真，进而由\n对角式使外层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 为假；它反驳\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 的可证性。</p>\n<p>论证依赖两个不同模型，而不是声称 KF 的外层逻辑是部分逻辑。加入排除\nglut 的一致性公理会改变模型类，届时需重新陈述可证性结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-liar-not-provable-—-裸-KF-不能判定说谎者及其真理原子","text":"thm-liar-not-provable — 裸 KF 不能判定说谎者及其真理原子","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-fixed-point-model","status":"resolved","